Guidelime.registerGuide([[
[D Quests for Zul Gurub \\ https://github.com/JanRK/Guidelime_DungeonQuests]
[N 60 20man Zul Gurub]
[NX 60 40man Ahn Qiraj]

Zul'Gurub is the troll city in the north-east of Stranglethorn Vale, reached by a jungle path east of the road between the Rebel Camp and Grom'gol. The Zandalar quest givers stand on Yojamba Isle, a small island off the north-west coast; there is no boat, so you swim the short stretch of sea.

-- Left out: 8227 Nat's Measuring Tape: starts from the Battered Tackle Box inside Zul'Gurub but is turned in to Nat Pagle in Dustwallow Marsh, an off-route trip across the sea. 8195, 8196, 8238, 8239, 8240, 8243 and 8246: repeatable Zandalar Tribe reputation turn-ins (coins, mangoes, bijous, potions, signets). 8041-8079, 8101-8119, 8141-8148, 8184-8192 and 9208-9210: class set, trinket, idol and enchant reward quests on Yojamba Isle, which need Zandalar reputation and loot from many runs (reputation gate unverified per quest). 8181 and 8182: the end of the Temple of Atal'Hakkar chain from Tanaris; it only sends you to Molthor and has no objective in Zul'Gurub. 8227 Nat's Measuring Tape: starts from a tackle box inside the raid but is turned in to Nat Pagle in Dustwallow Marsh, far off this route.

-- Horde: zeppelin to Grom'gol, then along the shore to Yojamba Isle.
[A Horde][OC] Take the zeppelin to Grom'gol from the tower outside Orgrimmar [G51.0,13.9 Durotar] or the Tirisfal Glades towers by Undercity [G61.2,58.9 Tirisfal Glades]
[A Horde][OC] Get off at the Grom'gol zeppelin tower [G31.5,29.1 Stranglethorn Vale]
[A Horde] Walk west out of Grom'gol to the shore [G29.5,26.5 Stranglethorn Vale] [OC] \\ An Elder Saltwater Crocolisk (elite 38) swims here, and Gluggle (elite 37) walks near 34,23.
[A Horde] North along the beach [G29.5,23.7 Stranglethorn Vale][G28.1,21.4 Stranglethorn Vale][G25.5,17.5 Stranglethorn Vale] [OC] \\ Saltscale Foragers and Hunters (elite 35-36) stand on the beach near 27,22.

-- Alliance: Stormwind, south through Elwynn and Duskwood into Stranglethorn, then west past Zul'Kunda to the coast.
[A Alliance] Start in Stormwind. At Dungar Longdrink, get the Stormwind flight path [P Stormwind] [G71.6,72.3 Stormwind City]
[A Alliance][OC] Over the canal bridge, out of the city gate and south down the road past Goldshire [G67.7,79.4 Stormwind City][G76.6,89.4 Stormwind City][G32.0,49.6 Elwynn Forest][G38.0,58.0 Elwynn Forest][G42.1,65.9 Elwynn Forest] \\ An Infernal (elite, level 30) stands near 34,53 by the road.
[A Alliance][OC] South on the road over the bridge into Duskwood [G42.3,84.9 Elwynn Forest]
[A Alliance][OC] South on the road to the south crossroads of Duskwood [G45.0,70.0 Duskwood] \\ Lost Watchers, Stitched Patrollers and Defias Night Blades (level 24-27) stand at the crossroads.
[A Alliance][OC] South into Stranglethorn Vale to the Rebel Camp [G38.0,4.0 Stranglethorn Vale]
[A Alliance][OC] West through the jungle toward the coast [G30.5,5.0 Stranglethorn Vale]
[A Alliance][OC] Through the Zul'Kunda ruins *(Gan'zulah and Nezzliok the Dire, level 40-41)* [G24.7,8.9 Stranglethorn Vale][G23.0,12.0 Stranglethorn Vale]
[A Alliance][OC] South to the coast [G25.5,17.5 Stranglethorn Vale]

-- Both factions: Yojamba Isle.
West along the beach to the water's edge [G21.0,16.0 Stranglethorn Vale] [OC]
Swim west across the sea to Yojamba Isle [G15.3,15.5 Stranglethorn Vale] [OC] \\ No boat is known in the sources; this swim is unverified in game.
Exzhal gives [QA8201 A Collection of Heads] [G15.3,15.5 Stranglethorn Vale]
Swim back east to the beach [G21.0,16.0 Stranglethorn Vale] [OC]
[A Horde] South along the coast [G25.5,17.5 Stranglethorn Vale][G28.1,21.4 Stranglethorn Vale][G29.5,23.7 Stranglethorn Vale][G29.5,26.5 Stranglethorn Vale] [OC]
[A Horde] Through Grom'gol and north on the road [G31.5,29.1 Stranglethorn Vale][G35.6,15.6 Stranglethorn Vale] [OC] \\ Tigers, panthers, gorillas and Bloodscalp trolls (level 30-34) live beside the road.
[A Horde] North to the road bridge over the river [G39.0,10.4 Stranglethorn Vale] [OC]
[A Alliance] East to the coast path and back past Zul'Kunda [G25.5,17.5 Stranglethorn Vale][G23.0,12.0 Stranglethorn Vale][G24.7,8.9 Stranglethorn Vale][G30.5,5.0 Stranglethorn Vale] [OC]
[A Alliance] East to the road at the Rebel Camp, then south to the river bridge [G38.0,4.0 Stranglethorn Vale][G39.0,10.4 Stranglethorn Vale] [OC]
East into the jungle along the river [G47.0,13.0 Stranglethorn Vale] [OC]
South on the jungle path, then east along the walled causeway to the gate of Zul'Gurub [G48.6,17.2 Stranglethorn Vale][G53.9,17.6 Stranglethorn Vale] [OC] \\ Gurubashi Warriors, Hakkari Oracles and High Priestess Hai'watna (elite 54-57) guard the causeway.

-- Inside Zul'Gurub.
Kill High Priest Venoxis, High Priestess Jeklik, High Priestess Mar'li, High Priest Thekal and High Priestess Arlokk for five Channeler's Heads [QC8201 A Collection of Heads]
Kill Hakkar and loot the Heart of Hakkar, which starts [QA8183 The Heart of Hakkar] \\ One heart drops per kill; it goes to one player.

-- Back to Yojamba Isle.
West out of the city along the causeway, then north on the jungle path [G48.6,17.2 Stranglethorn Vale][G47.0,13.0 Stranglethorn Vale] [OC]
West to the river bridge [G39.0,10.4 Stranglethorn Vale] [OC]
[A Horde] South on the road to Grom'gol and west to the shore [G35.6,15.6 Stranglethorn Vale][G31.5,29.1 Stranglethorn Vale][G29.5,26.5 Stranglethorn Vale] [OC]
[A Horde] North along the coast [G29.5,23.7 Stranglethorn Vale][G28.1,21.4 Stranglethorn Vale][G25.5,17.5 Stranglethorn Vale] [OC]
[A Alliance] North to the Rebel Camp, then west past Zul'Kunda to the coast [G38.0,4.0 Stranglethorn Vale][G30.5,5.0 Stranglethorn Vale][G24.7,8.9 Stranglethorn Vale][G23.0,12.0 Stranglethorn Vale][G25.5,17.5 Stranglethorn Vale] [OC]
West along the beach and swim to Yojamba Isle [G21.0,16.0 Stranglethorn Vale][G15.3,15.5 Stranglethorn Vale] [OC]
Exzhal takes [QT8201 A Collection of Heads] [G15.3,15.5 Stranglethorn Vale]
Molthor takes [QT8183 The Heart of Hakkar] [G15.0,15.1 Stranglethorn Vale]
]], 'DungeonQuests - JanRK')
